0..75 Comment "// A receive\'s payload written in parentheses reads as the payload whatever"
76..145 Comment "// type it holds, as a send\'s does, a sum among them. The receive and"
146..222 Comment "// the unknown type share the tile `?`, and the parenthesis after it settles"
223..297 Comment "// the receive: the unknown type is a whole type, and no type form goes on"
298..320 Comment "// with `(` after one."
321..323 Comment "//"
324..339 Comment "// - see: #1229"
341..415 Comment "/// A seat that receives an order, a sum written in place, and closes. The"
416..489 Comment "/// desk sends the order before the seat receives it, and the seat closes"
490..517 Comment "/// only after its receipt."
